WOH LADY JO NVIDIA KE ANDAR THI — 2-minute style demo (1930s Rubber Hose Cartoon)
Picture, score and sound effects: all original, drawn and synthesised in code for
this film. No existing cartoon character, design, melody, logo or photograph is used;
the people in the story are generic 1930s figures, not likenesses.

Engine
- Lemo-Opuscar library (lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar): core render/mux tools and the
  rubber-hose demo's technique files (toon.js constant-width ink + line boil,
  film.js gate/film-damage composite, chars.js anatomy kit, ui.js title lettering
  and title-card plates) — copied into this project and credited here.

Voice
- Microsoft Edge TTS (edge-tts), voice hi-IN-SwaraNeural @ +12%, run on GitHub
  Actions (superz1402/opus-video-engine, workflow opus-voice, run 43001880339);
  WordBoundary timings captured from the same run.

Music & sound effects
- Original score composed for this film and synthesised in numpy (music.py):
  stride piano, clarinet, trumpet, trombone, tuba, Karplus-Strong banjo,
  xylophone, woodblocks, brushes — no sample libraries, no third-party recordings.
- All foley synthesised in code (mix.py, with core/audio/sfx.py helpers).

